      "text": "as hybrid objects. Above all, AI acts as a sociocultural and symbolic mediator, deeply tied to language, serving as a bridge in communication and in the construction of meaning. Yet, in this new context, we must also recognize that in its integration, AI adopts human roles and epistemic virtues, like objectivity, responsibility, plausibility, reliability of knowledge and decision-making. The risk here lies in assigning to machine the profile as a scientific expert, capable of collecting, analyzing and standardizing data, without properly questioning the limit and basis. This is the framework of algorithmic collaboration between humans and machine, an interaction that, when properly oriented, amplifies our cognitive, analytical and creative capabilities. That, when poorly directed, can reinforce injustice and asymmetries.",
