      "duration": 78.35,
      "text": "In this landscape, AI has become a copilot that imitates human intelligence and multiplies productivity. We know and we now have systems of machine learning, narrow AI, specialized in specific domains. All AI as firing to match human cognition and future scenarios of superintelligence. All of these are reflected in daily application, like virtual assistance, voice and facial recognition, natural language processing, emotional analyze, automating recent generation of image, sounds and code. Modern interactions, audience segmentation or content creation. Generative AI, in particular, is redefining the way we produce and share information, but it also raises critical question, like, how do we face algorithmic gaps and injustice? How do we prevent AI from amplifying inequities, inequalities, polarization or misinformation?",
