      "text": "Imagine system training on multicultural and multilingual corpora, with the colonial awareness that help overcome the marginalization of historically silenced voices. Second, the idea of integral ecology are planet as a common home. AI can help monitor ecosystems, anticipate climate crisis, optimize energy networks and promote sustainable public policies, always with a sense of intergenerational responsibility. A third dimension is the reconfiguration of the social, emotional, imaginary. AI generates narratives, emotions, and means that shape collective, effective culture. Here the ethical question becomes excessive. What kinds of emotions does AI reproduce? Are they ethnically acceptable? Can we demand frameworks to guide their production responsibly? AI also opens opportunities in public health, clinical, diagnosed, digital mental health,",
